{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55606","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贪生养命事皆同，独坐闲居意颇慵。\n入夏驱驰巢树鹊，经春劳役探花蜂。\n石炉香尽寒灰薄，铁磬声微古綉浓。\n寂寂虚怀无一念，任从苍藓没行踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}